{"id":902,"slug":"who-are-you-polly-maggoo","title":"Who Are You, Polly Maggoo?","year":1966,"country":"France","duration":101,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/902-who-are-you-polly-maggoo","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/3ddd1ecfba3af948c3b1f9e834792fd1/KmELnGBvCJjy7FapP6JcGa1AeHwjtx_large.jpg","description":"After nearly a decade as American Vogue's most subversive fashion photographer, William Klein made this wild, pseudovérité incursion into the world of Parisian haute couture. Elegant, scathing humor ties together the various strands of this alternately glamorous and grotesque portrait of American in Paris Polly Maggoo (Dorothy MacGowan), an Alice in Wonderland supermodel who becomes the pinup plaything of media hounds and the fragmented fantasy of haunted Prince Igor (Sami Frey). Klein's first fiction film is a daring deflation of cultural pretensions and institutions, dressed up in brilliant black and white. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"William Klein","slug":"william-klein"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Dorothy MacGowan","role":"Polly Maggoo","slug":"dorothy-macgowan"},{"actor":"Jean Rochefort","role":"Grégoire Pecque","slug":"jean-rochefort"},{"actor":"Sami Frey","role":"Prince Igor","slug":"sami-frey"},{"actor":"Grayson Hall","role":"Miss Maxwell","slug":"grayson-hall"},{"actor":"Philippe Noiret","role":"Jean-Jacques Georges","slug":"philippe-noiret"},{"actor":"Alice Sapritch","role":"The Queen Mother","slug":"alice-sapritch"},{"actor":"Jacques Seiler","role":"Isidore Ducasse","slug":"jacques-seiler"},{"actor":"Pierre Baillot","role":"Prince’s spies","slug":"pierre-baillot"},{"actor":"Roland Topor","role":null,"slug":"roland-topor"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"William Klein","slug":"william-klein"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Robert Delpire","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"William Klein","slug":"william-klein"},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Jean Boffety","slug":null},{"ro